<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

    <OAGene_Thought_StarryNightP.stages.0.label>月夜中的故梦</OAGene_Thought_StarryNightP.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_StarryNightP.stages.0.description>和数年前的那个晚上一样...我的家人，我的朋友，我的同伴...仿佛都未曾离开。</OAGene_Thought_StarryNightP.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.0.label>归乡的期盼</OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.0.description>我已经很久没有回家了。在我离开的这些日子里，他们是否会因我而担心？</OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.1.label>归乡的执念</OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.1.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.1.description>我已经太久没有回家了。故乡的气息，亲人的声音，家中的温暖，我已经离开太久了...</OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.1.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.2.label>归乡的夙愿</OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.2.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.2.description>我曾经不明白离开家乡意味着什么，直到如今十余年过去后，我才明白离乡是怎么样的沉重。\n\n在这十余年里我得到了很多，但我再也没能找到我那朦胧的过去与记忆。</OAGene_Thought_ProtagonistHomecoming.stages.2.description>

    <!-- 回忆临时心情 -->
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.0.label>回忆中的过去</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.0.description>就像过去一样，那时大家都会在暴风雪里点起壁炉，暖黄色的火光会把整个小镇都给点亮，让人在风雪里也不会感到寒冷。</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.1.label>回忆中的过去</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.1.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.1.description>窗外的大雪，屋内的暖炉，忙着偷喝果酒的父亲，闻着酒香后追过来的母亲...小时候我总是那样的喜欢雪天。</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.1.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.2.label>回忆中的过去</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.2.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.2.description>曾经的大雪天里，镇上的那些雪地犬们总是会额外的亢奋，他们现在是否还会因为下雪而开心？</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.2.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.3.label>回忆中的过去</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.3.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.3.description>这样的风雪，总是让我不自觉的想起小时候的那些日子。站在镇口的时候，等待着父亲提着猎物归来。</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.3.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.4.label>回忆中的过去</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.4.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.4.description>记得曾经的那些大雪天里，修女小姐总是会为没能及时回家的镇民们祷告。\n那样善良的她，现在是否过得还好？</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.4.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.5.label>回忆中的过去</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.5.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.5.description>为什么大家都不在，我明明已经回来了...这样的风雪天里，大家都应该在镇子上的才对...</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.5.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.6.label>回忆中的过去</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.6.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.6.description>我总是会不自觉的以为镇子还和过去一样，仿佛只要走出房门就会看到大家还在镇子上。</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.6.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.7.label>回忆中的过去</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.7.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.7.description>大家还会回来吗？就像过去那样，一起在风雪里沿着镇子上的小路追逐打闹...\n那样的日子明明我还没有过够...</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Temp.stages.7.description>

    <!-- 回忆永久心情 -->
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.0.label>过去的和解</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.0.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.0.description>我不该再这样落魄下去了。那些幸福不应该成为如今拘束我的锁链，也许我应该寻找我真正的未来。</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.0.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.1.label>昔日的温柔</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.1.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.1.description>曾经的那些记忆不再是困扰我的枷锁，他们将成为我心中的篝火，陪伴我在暴风雪之中继续前行。</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.1.description>

    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.2.label>永远的记忆</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.2.label>
    <OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.2.description>曾经的我为了追寻过去而失去了很多。而现在我将不会再为过去所困惑。\n\n那回不去的过去，将让我更加珍视我已拥有的一切，并在我的心中支撑着我度过下一个明天。</OAGene_Thought_LostInMemory_Permanent.stages.2.description>

</LanguageData>